  "body_text": "门店春节期间店休安排如下：\n浦西店 Lucky Draw\n2.15 - 2.23 休息， 2.24（初八）恢复正常营业\n浦东店 Lovely Thoughts\n2.13 - 2.23 休息， 2.24（初八）12:00 - 17:30 半天营业；2.25恢复正常营业时间；\n工厂春节期间放假和发货安排：\n2.13 - 2.23 休息，2.24（初八）复工生产\n淘宝店铺不打烊，但是可售卖和发货品相有调整：\n2.13 - 2.23期间仅有挂耳包混合品相和分享装混合装（16g*7）",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           门店春节期间店休安排如下：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-weight: bold;\">\n           浦西店 Lucky Draw\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n             2.15 - 2.23 休息， 2.24（初八）恢复正常营业\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-weight: bold;\">\n           浦东店 Lovely Thoughts\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n             2.13 - 2.23 休息， 2.24（初八）12:00 - 17:30 半天营业；2.25恢复正常营业时间；\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: bold;\">\n           工厂春节期间放假和发货安排：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n             2.13 - 2.23 休息，2.24（初八）复工生产\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: bold;\">\n           淘宝店铺不打烊，但是可售卖和发货品相有调整：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n             2.13 - 2.23期间仅有挂耳包混合品相和分享装混合装（16g*7）\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b61YM0kezZZGmz0KRtLs4VF2xI548iaSC3ZuQPrtPFh9qgeue0gPibXljaQjb2qicxz3KHibBDg7avyibEgmiaqQ1IEic0icf9VwPGM0oM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b6P2e5pX2ictF0kibuQYExU4lmIgaibRmHtyQjUGgDB4tuBiaOjRHeeEm7AtHTQq3XMvDQObiaBpHQY2DR3Zrg7fsniakjmID9IGAgC4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
